@255 = ~Call Fire Servant~
@256 = ~Call Fire Servant (Conjuration, Summoning)
Level: 5
Sphere: conjuration, elemental (fire)
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the preacher of flames to contact the elemental plane of fire to summon a fire elemental, an efreet or a salamander. The summoned creature's rank or strength is random:
Elemental: 8 HD, 12 HD in 30% of cases.
Salamander: superior in 40% of cases.
Efreet: noble in 8% of cases.~
@25699 = ~Call Fire Servant (Conjuration, Summoning)
Level: 5
Sphere: conjuration, elemental (fire)
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the preacher of flames to contact the elemental plane of fire to summon a fire creature living there. He may call almost any elemental or related creature, but its rank or strength is random:
Elemental: 8 HD, 12 HD in 30% of cases, 16 HD in 10% of cases.
Salamander: superior in 40% of cases, noble in 15% of cases.
Efreet: noble in 15% of cases.
Fire Plasm: giant in 40% of cases.
Inferno Spider: 15% chance to summon a second spider.
Fire Bats: special: appear in groups of 1d6+3.
Fire Mephits: special: appear in groups of 1d4+2.~
