@257 = ~Ardent Mantle~
@258 = ~Ardent Mantle (Abjuration)
Level: 5
Sphere: protection, elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds / level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

By casting this spell, the preacher of flames surrounds himself with an aura of crackling sparks. This grants him a +2 concealment bonus to AC and complete immunity to natural and magical fire.
In addition, any creature he touches suffers 2D4 points of fire damage, and any creature that touches him suffers 2D4 fire damage and must make a successful save vs. spell or catch fire.
A creature set ablaze in this way suffers 2D4 points of damage per round for another 1d6 rounds. Its attack rolls suffer a -2 penalty during this time.~
@2581 = ~Ardent Mantle (Abjuration)
Level: 5
Sphere: protection, elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

By casting this spell, the preacher of flames surrounds himself with an aura of crackling sparks. This grants him a +2 concealment bonus to AC and complete immunity to natural and magical fire.
In addition, any creature he touches suffers 2D4 +1 point of fire damage, and any creature that touches him suffers 2D4 +1 fire damage and must make a successful save vs. spell or catch fire.
A creature set ablaze in this way suffers 2D4 +1 point of damage per round for another 1d6 rounds. Its attack rolls suffer a -2 penalty during this time.
All instances of 2D4 +1 damage from this spell become 1D8 +2 at level 30 and 2D4 +2 at level 40.~
@2582 = ~Ardent Mantle (Abjuration)
